424:### 12.1 Algorithm
441:On rotated Blend (frequencies from 11.2), the edges by weight are `bb.3 → bb.7` (7.33), `bb.7 → bb.3` (6.45), `bb.0 → bb.3` and `bb.7 → bb.2` (0.88 each), `bb.0 → bb.2` (0.12) and `bb.3 → bb.4` (0). The first links `bb.3, bb.7`; the back edge cannot be linked; `bb.0 → bb.3` gives `bb.0, bb.3, bb.7`; `bb.7 → bb.2` gives `bb.0, bb.3, bb.7, bb.2`; the trap block `bb.4` is a chain of its own and comes last:
